: "432285677886946", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75458091_432285681220279_7535572255127238121_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ByOnam1quL4Q7kNvwEjZep_&_nc_oc=AdmSNB7FrS2-YQCj1-OW1Vs5Vmam_IRQKoFUUUaT4BTSmcntfZGFO-b4hRlCTLtlxWg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afws56yrMcvf2e90Gkzi_f4h7jq-vkpMjit9weC67bPyQw&oe=69B3F6B7"}, "display_name": "Counter Fight ICHIRAN", "keywords": ["ICHIRAN", "CounterFight", "JobSimulator", "Ramen", "cooking"], "long_description": "Make some mouth-watering ramen!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game created with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan. Established over 60 years ago, it's been perfecting its hit specialty tonkotsu ramen for a long time, which is why ICHIRAN's ramen is the best in the land. In fact, it's often touted in the media as a \"must-try cuisine\" for foreign visitors.\n\nGame Features:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score! \nImmersive kitchen-based gameplay lets you experience life as a real ICHIRAN employee, racking up points for your ramen preparation skills and speedy delivery.\n\n\u30fbClimb the ranks in store management mode! \nYour score in store management mode is entered into a world ranking. Boost your profits to employ more staff and increase seating capacity as you try to hit the high scores with your own unique store!\n\n*In-game kitchen layout may differ from actual restaurants.", "short_description": "Cook some knockout noodles!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game made with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous organic tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan, often touted as a \"must-try cuisine\" for tourists. It has outlets in NY, Hong Kong, and Taiwan, too.\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score!\n\u30fbTake top place in store management mode!\n\u30fbBoost profits, employ more staff, up capacity, and hit the high scores with your own unique store!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "MiniLandscape.png", "id": "3838591046231584", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984462_3838591052898250_5002299579482394963_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zwJV2ZC-OHcQ7kNvwFDxxEa&_nc_oc=Admro6_PCIZt2EZD1HcLvQJT_SQn5NufgncSIJZHIk1HwZT1tATxrRrfxNG_-_T307I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyaUh4N6Rq-CKKD0kqwvR7mwSCbJpUPQpkzYqZcpqDOXA&oe=69B400DE"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "2182671695203710", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75641339_2182671698537043_1819436220465957851_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ewu4y-nHlccQ7kNvwHnAuel&_nc_oc=AdmBWnYdV5mj7ViX8NIuJHUhs-5_9nsgTUeciTxE2CyZLJW0tZRO2kcTwE10lLUBFOI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwlkcysQeEVpzIMgPHpEaSBaNHkNjHsjq-zAdWFPxVwfg&oe=69B4167B"}, {"file_name": "icon.png", "id": "446502446404480", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75476755_446502449737813_695504826495623275_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G6jIm6w_0fEQ7kNvwGw47PG&_nc_oc=Adl-zJPAmmV-snNUHl0G1QBH2YXEAJJz2h5qkecrZcwQSMyC0wiHH70NRiqMUssrba4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzQa2CBC4iVpccsERqGjBxX9XNT4B2wdG98dQuTWZP_ZA&oe=69B402A1"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover.png", "id": "442920633578734", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240108_442920636912067_8939691330164956004_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2c038yLFXNQQ7kNvwERAwOf&_nc_oc=AdnCQuK3eFHIveZEmqV_pTzgQBTSDmENA6fydHHN0gj8f60m7OzLtkNbgAcayvaUSbQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyZLGDbjiDkYr71XXOEs7Z2yQ4rid_JP-5EfuguZGiYQg&oe=69B41C88"}, {"file_name": "CoverPor